{{#> main title="Results" }}
  <h1>Results Summary: Machine Learning Methods Comparison</h1>
  
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>This page presents a comprehensive comparison of all machine learning methods applied to Counter-Strike 2 professional match data throughout this project. The analysis covered both supervised and unsupervised learning approaches, each providing unique insights into player behavior and round outcome prediction.</p>
    
    <p>The primary prediction task was determining the winner of individual game rounds based on features extracted from professional match demos. Additionally, unsupervised methods were used to discover natural groupings in player behavior data.</p>
  </div>

