            <td>Best performer with 2,507 samples; ROC AUC of 0.942; economy features dominate</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>AdaBoost</strong></td>
            <td>Supervised (Ensemble)</td>
            <td>Round Winner Prediction</td>
            <td><strong>83.33%</strong></td>
            <td>Strong sample reweighting with larger dataset</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>XGBoost</strong></td>
            <td>Supervised (Ensemble)</td>
            <td>Round Winner Prediction</td>
            <td><strong>83.33%</strong></td>
